st below.\n\n\nDetails of your request\nRequested character\nNakula.\nHe is a cool looking man.\nIn everyday life, he is an ordinary company employee,\nHe is an ordinary company employee in daily life, but he also has a secret side where he undertakes undercover operations, espionage, and assassinations.\nHe is not interested in other people and is not sociable,\nHe is not interested in other people and is unsociable, but he laughs a lot and is very sweet to those who get to know him.\nHe also has a mischievous side.\n\n(Please refer to the following URL for reference images.\n(Please refer to the URL of the image for reference. https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1o-suqUp9rJv1jJIX5uErvv9bYWSIan31?usp=sharing)\n\n\nWe will leave the facial expressions and composition to you.\nWe are happy to arrange the glasses, clothing and hair style.\n\n\nUsage\nActivities on Youtube, Twitch, etc. (video clips, streaming, thumbnails, etc.)\nActivities on social networking sites such as X (Twitter) and promotional posts\nUse in merchandise and online print distribution (if this is not allowed, we would appreciate it if you could write it down somewhere on the layer).\n\nPlease include the following information.\nIf there is an address or background, it would be greatly appreciated if you could provide a transparent image of the person only.\nWe would very much appreciate your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sushi_171/works/58", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c712c634/uploads/origins/f09e48cb-2227-4314-8538-97d57095edde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0df82c195dfe1128d39c8e73231913b3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c712c634/uploads/origins/f09e48cb-2227-4314-8538-97d57095edde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0df82c195dfe1128d39c8e73231913b3, https://si.imgix.net/c712c634/uploads/origins/f09e48cb-2227-4314-8538-97d57095edde?bg=%23fff&auto=format