le with the character data separate from the background. Thanks for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sushi_171/works/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/04022732/uploads/origins/30998024-b989-489d-b5e5-f4507a683280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afba35d4a5f5fa26b5ab61625ef6935a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04022732/uploads/origins/30998024-b989-489d-b5e5-f4507a683280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=afba35d4a5f5fa26b5ab61625ef6935a, https://si.imgix.net/04022732/uploads/origins/30998024-b989-489d-b5e5-f4507a683280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da769924afedb7215755ac836117b341 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04022732/uploads/origins/30998024-b989-489d-b5e5-f4507a683280?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24e9e23383cce667de454e41036f2179 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "My name is Arm_OrAk.\nI am Arm_OrAk.\nI would like to ask you to create a military uniform as a base, including facial expression differences.\nThank you very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sushi_171/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84525acb/uploads/origins/70db64c6-23c4-479b-a9cc-b3c7c12dcadb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bdf8d7df039edd0c0f733a1755884c0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84525acb/uploads/origins/70db64c6-23c4-479b-a9cc-b3c7c12dcadb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2bdf8d7df039edd0c0f733a1755884c0, https://si.imgix.net/84525acb/uploads/origins/70db64c6-23c4-479b-a9cc-b3c7c12dcadb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0dddcb652c2fd2821706cc2c453a67f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/84525acb/uploads/origins/70db64c6-23c4-479b-a9cc-b3c7c12dcadb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=we